member.remarks:
The fixed list of FeederTypes is {TapeFeederType,LinearFeederType,TrayFeederType,MatrixTrayFeederType}
which map to the following ReserveTypes respectively
{TapeFixedReserveType,LinearReserveType,TrayReserveType,TrayReserveType}.
